# The build context is the repo root. Without this, `COPY web/ web/` would
# overwrite the node_modules that `pnpm install` just built in the image with
# the host's (wrong platform), and the Rust stage would drag in target/.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
target
**/.next
**/out
test-results
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
e2e/secrets
